# GreenLink Delhi - Frontend Configuration (Professional GIS Workstation)

# 1. MapTiler API Key (Optional)
# If provided, enables MapTiler Streets v2, Satellite Aerial, Hybrid, and Dataviz Light vector styles.
# If omitted or invalid, application visibly alerts and gracefully falls back to OpenStreetMap, Carto Positron, & Esri Imagery.
# Sign up / get key at: https://cloud.maptiler.com/
VITE_MAPTILER_API_KEY=

# 2. Mapillary Client Token (Optional)
# If provided, enables inline street-level imagery inspection near candidate corridors.
# If omitted, application provides direct links to Mapillary Web and Google Street View.
# Get free client token at: https://www.mapillary.com/dashboard/developers
VITE_MAPILLARY_CLIENT_TOKEN=

# 3. Default Basemap Style URL (Optional override)
# Default is OpenFreeMap Bright (https://tiles.openfreemap.org/styles/bright)
# Alternatives:
# VITE_BASEMAP_STYLE=https://tiles.openfreemap.org/styles/bright
# VITE_BASEMAP_STYLE=https://tiles.openfreemap.org/styles/positron
# VITE_BASEMAP_STYLE=https://tiles.openfreemap.org/styles/liberty
